/**********************/
/* ACT II - AREA 5    */
/* LAVA PUZZLE ROOM   */
/**********************/

/**********************/
:: Area 5

/* Player enters lava cave */

> You enter the lava room.

> Heat fills the cave.

> Lava begins to rise.

> You need to press buttons before time runs out.


>> [[[Find the first button.|area5_button1]]]
/**********************/


/**********************/
:: area5_button1

> You find the first button and press it.

> The lava slows down a little.


>> [[[Find the second button.|area5_button2]]]

/**********************/

/**********************/
:: area5_button2

> You find the second button and press it.

> The lava slows again.

> One last button remains.


>> [[[Find the final button.|area5_button3]]]

/**********************/

/**********************/

:: area5_button3

/* Hidden final button */

> You look around the cave.

> Then you turn behind you and find the final hidden button.

> You press it.


>> [[[Reveal the gemstone.|area5_end]]]

/**********************/

/**********************/

:: area5_end

/* Gemstone collected */

> The cave shakes.

> The gemstone rises from the ground.

> You grab it quickly.


>> [[[Continue.|act2_transition]]]

